  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistical cooperation between SSB and INE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support development of capacity for production and use of official statistics in Mozambique and will be aligned with the National Strategy for Development of Statistics. he project will be organised around the following four components:1) Basic Economic statistics, 2) Energy statistics, 3) National Accounts and 4) Communication and Dissemination of statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
